        "en": "Dedicated care with occasional friction"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Longtime clients frequently praise the dedication of Dr. Bobby, Dr. Trent, and the assisting technicians, describing them as compassionate and helpful with dogs, cats, and birds. However, three critical reviews cite abrupt bedside manner from Dr. Dori or indifferent reception staff, contrasting with the warm, reassuring service reported by most visitors."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Accommodating care for diverse pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners value that the clinic treats a broad variety of pets, including dogs, cats, birds, and small animals. Several reviews emphasize gentle handling during stressful visits, including side-door access for reactive dogs and thoughtful support during end-of-life care. Clients note that staff genuinely care about animal well-being."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Helpful advice alongside diagnostic frustrations"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Multiple pet owners appreciate Dr. Bobby's candid advice and thorough explanations of treatment options without high-pressure sales pitches. Conversely, two dissatisfied clients reported poor communication regarding diagnoses, lack of attentive listening during follow-up visits, and difficulties obtaining requested paperwork from the office."
      }
    }
  ],
